8. **Meta Context Engineering via Agentic Skill Evolution (MCE).** arXiv, 2026\. [paper](https://arxiv.org/abs/2601.21557), [PDF-en](papers/en/2601.21557_MCE.pdf), [PDF-zh](papers/zh/2601.21557_MCE_zh.pdf)
