| 12 | [TMLR 综述](reports/12_self_evolving_agents_survey.md) | What / When / How / Where | 四维分类；现有基准测不到知识积累 |
| 13 | [Meta-Harness](reports/13_meta_harness.md) | 外部 proposer 读全部历史 | proposer 需要完整执行轨迹，摘要不够 |
